---
source: crates/notify/tests/email.rs
expression: out
---
Subject: 10 things need your attention on postit

--- text ---
These need your attention:

- A post to Corner Shop on mastodon could not be published after several attempts.
- A post to Corner Shop on mastodon failed.
- postit could not confirm whether a post to Corner Shop on mastodon went out.
- A post to Corner Shop on mastodon is on hold: the platform's posting limit was reached.
- A post to Corner Shop on mastodon has been on hold too long and needs you: the account must be reconnected.
- A post went out, but 3 of its accounts failed.
- Corner Shop on mastodon needs to be reconnected.
- mastodon revoked postit's access to Corner Shop.
- The date to reconnect Corner Shop on mastodon has passed.
- A recurring post skipped an occurrence: the previous occurrence is still publishing.

Open postit: https://app.postit.test/app/

You are receiving this email because email notifications are on in your postit settings.
